eld":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":11.1,"_gate_share_shrink":null,"_gp_share_shrink":null,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.012628577937317233,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":79.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.40104,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":100.0,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"Neutron Holdings, Inc., doing business as Lime, provides electric vehicle sharing services in the United States. The company offers dock-free bikes and scooters for riding through its mobile application. It offers Gen 4.1 scooters, e-scooters, e-bikes, Gen 3 e-scooters, Lime jump e-bikes, and Gen4 seated e-scooters. The company was incorporated in 2017 and is based in San Francisco, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Hsing-Yuan Wayne Ting | CEO & Director | Age 41 | Compensation: $1.0M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"R&D investment of 6% of revenue (moderate) signals commitment to product development and talent.","financial_summary":["Neutron Holdings, Inc. is a small-cap industrials business with a $1.3B market cap on $887M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +30% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder. Operating margins are expanding by +6.3pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","Returns on capital run at 36% against a 7% cost of capital \u2014 a 28-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat, with gross margins sitting at 39%.","The business throws off $104M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 12 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, debt is moderate at 3.5\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, serviceable in normal conditions but worth watching through a downturn, and interest coverage runs at 3.4\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 40% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 121% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":1.2055854026860544},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (-0.0) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average SGA growth (18% YoY) warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"trend"},{"text":"Cyclicality and capital intensity \u2014 order books turn on a dime, and the heavy fixed cost base that creates the moat also magnifies the downturn.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Supply chain reshoring costs and labour shortages \u2014 onshoring mandates raise capex requirements while a shrinking skilled-labour pool inflates operating costs.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Tariff and trade-policy exposure \u2014 industrial exporters sit squarely in the crosshairs of protectionist policy, and retaliatory tariffs can close markets without warning.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 61% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Industrials peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Growing faster than most Industrials peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Lime to Participate in Upcoming Investor Conferences","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/lime-participate-upcoming-investor-conferences-130000277.html","date":"2026-11-17","timestamp":1794920400.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.34,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Contrasting Neutron (NASDAQ:LIME) & Uber Technologies (NYSE:UBER)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/11/contrasting-neutron-nasdaqlime-uber-technologies-nyseuber.html","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794388504.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.934,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Neutron (NASDAQ:LIME) Stock Gets Price Target Trim from JPMorgan Chase & Co.","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/07/neutron-nasdaqlime-stock-gets-price-target-trim-from-jpmorgan-chase-co.html","date":"2026-11-07","timestamp":1794067674.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.202,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"LIME Investigation Notice: SueWallSt Notifies Investors of Pending Investigation Into LIME (LIME)","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/lime-investigation-notice-suewallst-notifies-investors-of-pending-investigation-into-lime-lime-302929823.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793836320.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["legal"]},{"title":"Neutron (LIME) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"fool.com","link":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/neutron-lime-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/?source=iedfolrf0000001","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793809642.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Neutron (NASDAQ:LIME) Releases Quarterly Earnings Results, Beats Estimates By $0.20 EPS","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/20